
flowchart TD
    A[OnWakeWordDetected] --> B{CurrentState.State != WaitingForWakeWord<br>OR !CurrentState.IsEnabled}
    B -->|True| C[Return]
    B -->|False| D[Log "Wake word detected"]
    D --> E[UpdateState to WakeWordDetected]
    E --> F{TextToSpeech Enabled<br>AND ResponsePhrase not empty}
    F -->|True| G[Start Task to Speak ResponsePhrase]
    G --> H{Task Success?}
    H -->|Yes| I[Log "Speaking wake word response"]
    H -->|No| J[Log Error "Error speaking wake word response"]
    F -->|False| K[Skip Speaking Response]
    K --> L[Delay 1000ms]
    L --> M[BeginListeningForCommandAsync]
    G --> L